---
description: Stack and conventions for the Scrum poker TFM
alwaysApply: true
---

- TypeScript strict in `shared`, `backend`, and `frontend`.
- No Firebase. Realtime is Socket.IO + Redis.
- Event names, card values, and room types live in `shared/` (`@scrum-poker/shared`) only.
- Vue 3 Composition API + `<script setup>`. Fastify on the server.
- UI language: Spanish.
